sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as B Clinician
    participant CP as Control Plane
    participant M as Patient Mobile
    participant B as B Gateway
    participant A as Audit
    C->>CP: OIDC+MFA, create Handoff(B,purpose,TTL)
    CP->>A: HANDOFF_CREATED
    CP-->>C: opaque one-time QR Ticket
    M->>CP: scan Ticket + device proof
    CP-->>M: safe B/purpose/scope summary
    M->>CP: patient re-auth + approve(package,consent)
    CP->>CP: consent+institution+clinician+Study+Ticket+device ABAC
    CP->>A: POLICY_ALLOW/DENY
    CP-->>M: short Package Transfer Token
    M->>B: start/chunk/complete ciphertext upload
    B->>B: manifest, count, hash, GCM tag verify
    B->>CP: key-release authorization request
    CP-->>B: authorized B key envelope
    B->>B: unwrap in B trust zone; view/import policy
    B->>CP: signed Delivery Receipt + consume Ticket (atomic)
    CP->>A: RECEIVED/VERIFIED/CONSUMED
    CP-->>M: delete or cryptographically disable package

%% Error contract: expired/revoked/wrong institution/replay/device blocked => DENY before upload/key release.
%% Interrupted upload resumes only with a fresh grant and verified chunk checkpoint.
%% Gateway/Relay/PACS failure never permits direct browser-to-PACS bypass.
